 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time complexity:** Sampling is $O(N_{patch})$ where $N_{patch}$ is the number of rays in the patch. The overhead of coordinate generation is negligible compared to ray casting.
+- **Time complexity:** Sampling is $O(N_{patch})$ where $N_{patch}$ is the number of rays in the patch. The overhead of coordinate generation is negligible compared to ray casting. [G]
